---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const principles = [
  ['Architecture and implementation', 'The people shaping the technical direction stay close to the system being built.'],
  ['Ownership through production', 'Operational realities, recovery and maintainability are design inputs—not handover concerns.'],
  ['Security as engineering', 'Security belongs in architecture, infrastructure and delivery workflows, supported by practical validation.'],
  ['Direct technical communication', 'Clear decisions, explicit tradeoffs and useful documentation keep complex work understandable.'],
];
---

<Layout title="Company | Catdev" description="Catdev is an engineering-led enterprise technology company focused on senior technical delivery across cloud, security and enterprise systems.">
  <section class="enterprise-grid border-b border-white/10 pt-36 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-28"><div class="container-custom"><p class="eyebrow">Company</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl">Focused engineering for systems that matter.</h1><p class="section-copy mt-7 max-w-3xl">Catdev is an engineering-led technology company serving organizations that need senior technical ownership across cloud platforms, security and enterprise software delivery.</p></div></section>

  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-custom"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h2 class="section-title">Small by design. Serious about delivery.</h2><p class="section-copy mt-6">Catdev emphasizes capability, direct communication and responsibility—not layers of consulting process or manufactured scale.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">{principles.map(([title, copy]) => <article class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">{title}</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-steel">{copy}</p></article>)}</div></div></div></section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] section-padding"><div class="container-custom"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">Technical foundation</p><h2 class="section-title">Experience across the complete system.</h2></div><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel"><p>More than fifteen years of work across software engineering, cloud and infrastructure operations, Kubernetes, storage, identity systems, security engineering, observability and recovery planning informs how Catdev approaches enterprise delivery.</p><p>Open-source maintenance and hands-on engineering projects add depth across systems integration, automation, private AI infrastructure, networking and hardware-dependent environments.</p><p>Security credentials documented in the existing company material include OSCP, OSCE, CPTS, CWES and OSWP. They support a broader security-engineering practice rather than defining the company around offensive testing.</p></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="section-padding"><div class="container-custom"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.7fr] lg:gap-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white md:text-4xl">Jan Mueller</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-steel">Catdev is led by Jan Mueller, a senior engineer whose background spans production infrastructure, software delivery and security. The company model keeps senior technical decision-making close to customers and implementation work.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.025] p-6"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Company information</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-steel">CATDEV LLC<br />Florida limited liability company<br />Serving customers internationally</p><a href="/imprint" class="mt-5 inline-block text-cyan hover:text-white">Legal information →</a></div></div></div></section>

  <section class="pb-20 md:pb-28"><div class="container-custom"><div class="rounded-lg border border-cyan/20 bg-deep-space/60 p-8 text-center md:p-12"><p class="eyebrow">Work with Catdev</p><h2 class="section-title">Direct access to senior engineering.</h2><a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8">Start a conversation</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
